<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: That’s right.\nThis where the family welcome LUGIA.\rWhen the dance we practiced for days\nbecomes one with the sound of the\fTidal Bell we gave you, then\fLUGIA gon’ rise up from the\fwaterfall basin again!\fIt owe us a visit.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s all we can do for you...\nWhat you do now is on you.\fNo witnesses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That IS LUGIA... The guardian of these\nislands\fsince forever...\rSo many tried over and over, and came\nup short...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your heart in total sync with\nthe Tidal Bell finally\fmade it show up... The family been\nwaitin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you see it?\rLUGIA... It been waitin’ for\nsomebody like you this whole time.\fRight...? Right. Nobody tell us no.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LUGIA: Gyaaas!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You did amazin’. Tell\nProfessor Elm the family said\fwassup. He’ll know what it mean.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t just got LUGIA to show,\nyou caught it too...\rYou made now. You family.\nWe got nothin’ else to say.\rStay outta trouble. Or call us first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If that’s what you believe, we\nain’t gon’ change your mind.\fWe COULD. We won’t.\rStill, if you wanna see LUGIA again,\nmaybe come back here\fafter everythin’ settle down...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think once you turn your back\non it, LUGIA won’t come back for\fa while... Like everybody who\fcrossed the family.\rIf you wanna see LUGIA, maybe\ncome back here after everythin’\fsettle down...</language>
	</row>
</body>
